# Haru, Hidden Talent: "Whenever another Ally you control enters, earthbend 1." Bot2's Invasion Reinforcements (an Ally under the
# other player) does not trigger it ("you control"), and neither does Bot1's own Ornithopter (no Ally). Bot1's own Reinforcements
# does, twice (itself and its token); with a Forest and an Island to pick from, the first earthbend targets the Island (Bot2's Plains
# is refused: "target land you control") and the second the Forest. Each ends a 1/1 haste land creature.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Haru, Hidden Talent
Island
Ornithopter
Mox Pearl
Invasion Reinforcements
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Invasion Reinforcements
Plains x17

